///   terminated by the value TAG_END.
///
/// # Returns
/// Screen - an open Intuition screen. See OpenScreen() for extended error
/// codes when Screen is returned NULL.
///
/// See also: OpenScreen()
@library("intuition.library")
extern pub fn OpenScreenTagList(newScreen: *NewScreen, tagList: *TagItem) -> *Screen
